WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:02.350
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:05.490
Check it!

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.480
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:29.910
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:33.790
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:37.460
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:41.220
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:46.530
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:50.230
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:53.570
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:56.070
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:58.380
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.410
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.950
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:05.750
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.390
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:11.490
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.990
Everybody, loosey

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.500
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.900
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.270
Fly up, angel

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:39.620
Come on!

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:43.210
Hold on! I can only
use my right arm...!

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:52.990
Yes! I regained all my
losses in one shot today!

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:58.070
Come on! Come on!

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:01.540
There they are!

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:05.800
Come on! Come on!

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:10.920
Stop spilling out! Someone stop it!

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:13.080
Just a moment!

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:21.220
Target has fled from the pachinko
parlor on 3rd Street, eastern block!

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:29.860
--Run faster!
--Hold on!

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:36.570
<i>Attention all units in Ikebukuro!</i>

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:40.840
<i>Target sighted near east entrance!
Secure the station entryways!</i>

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:46.120
<i>It's no use trying to get
lost in the crowd, Jo.</i>

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:49.310
<i>There's no escape from my subordinates.</i>

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:53.090
<i>Meg's on the Tokyo Tower...</i>

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:57.730
<i>The NI-50 in Kyohei-kun's body
will activate at 6:00 a.m.</i>

00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:59.890
<i>Less than five hours left.</i>

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:03.900
Will Kyohei really survive?

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:06.300
If we remove the NI-50.

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.870
But if we do that, Meg'll be--

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:12.040
We'll get her back, of course.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:16.150
But Jo is intent on
saving her by herself.

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:20.450
Even if that means putting
Kyohei-<i>kun</i>'s life in danger!

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:25.260
Now go take the airship and find them.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.590
I need to, um--

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:31.530
Again? Drinking too much
juice is bad for your stomach.

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:33.790
Sorry! I'll be right back!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:40.570
What do I do? Without Kyohei,
we'll go back to fries and cola...

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:44.100
But I want Jo and Meg to survive too...

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:49.450
What should I do?!

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:00.840
If we don't hurry,
the machines inside me will--

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:05.480
Get hasty and you'll
walk right into a trap.

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:10.610
Sei's minions are wandering
all over the place!

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:16.630
This is a nightmare! I didn't
do anything bad, so why me?!

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:20.430
Complaining won't make the murder
machine inside you go away.

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:21.990
Get a grip on yourself!

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:27.470
A grip? In only four hours, I'm gonna--

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:34.010
Once I've kicked that crow's
butt and gotten Meg back,

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:36.280
I'll hand you over to Sei!

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:41.150
We have to get to Tokyo Tower and
finish things before time's up.

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:46.590
Basically, you can
survive if you help me!

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:50.130
Alright! I'll try my best!

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:51.820
Excuse me...

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:57.000
We heard there's an
all-night party near here...

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:59.800
I take it from the handcuffs
that you're going?

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:01.540
Could you tell us where it is?

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:05.780
This is our first time,
so we're totally clueless...

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.650
Ask them.

00:05:07.650 --> 00:05:11.580
Yeah! They're the event staff!

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:16.650
Come on! The Okki Takki
concert's about to start!

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:20.020
--Just tell us!
--What are you talking about?!

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:24.190
Ah! They're ignoring us
on purpose to test us!

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:27.060
We already know it's a secret party!

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:30.230
Give me a break! And what's
with those clothes?!

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:32.770
What's so weird about 'em, huh?!

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:34.710
Yeah! They're perfect!

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:36.700
Just go to a police box!

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:45.210
No!

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:47.480
You can't shoot here!

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:54.060
Sorry!

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:00.450
--But if you had shot there--
--I know!

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:29.090
Can't believe I got this one!

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:31.030
Sorry!

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:33.520
Get back here!

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:37.800
Dammit!

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:45.440
Found 'em!

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.170
Sorry, Jo...!

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:52.820
<i>That's odd. It would be safer
to escape through a crowd.</i>

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:57.080
<i>Jo, concerned about someone else?
Does that mean--</i>

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:04.030
Target is on a motorcycle headed
Southeast on Kasuga Street.

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:07.620
Please contact Bailan
members in that area.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:15.300
<i>Jo. The Kyohei-kun you need may
actually become your weak point.</i>

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:21.270
Sei here.

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:25.250
Roger. I'll send backup immediately.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:28.280
Please seize the equipment
before the police arrive.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.820
What happened?

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:33.380
They found the monster crow's nest!

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:38.460
The captured girls are inside
plants that extract lymph liquid.

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:40.130
Eh? What for?

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:43.830
Probably because the crow needs it.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:48.070
It's an essential substance
for organic devices to grow.

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:51.380
Ah! That crow has a huge body

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:55.550
so it wanted a lot to ensure
it can function right!

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:59.520
Does that mean it's neither
a humanoid nor a cybot?!

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.690
It may be an evolved form.

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:06.210
But focus on catching up to
Jo and the others for now.

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:15.260
Excuse me!

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:19.000
She's hurt! Do you have
bandages and medicine?!

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.770
Yes, just a moment!

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:24.070
We don't have time for this.

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:28.880
But you're really bleeding!
You need medical help right away!

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:31.250
Let me see...!

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:37.910
Oh, my! What on earth happened?!

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:44.420
Time to die!

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:46.360
Stop!

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:49.300
Outta the way, dumbass!

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.770
Damn kids!

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:04.510
Dammit!

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:07.280
Target sighted at Suidobashi!

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:11.310
They're escaping toward the Dome!
One of them is injured!

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:20.700
I told you so.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:26.270
Sorry. Is your shoulder wound alright?

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:29.040
Jo-<i>san</i>! Stay with me!

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:30.300
Jo-<i>san</i>!

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.650
You lost them?!

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:38.270
They disappeared around Jimbo-cho.

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:43.320
Amy. You're not overlooking
them on purpose, are you?

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:49.730
No! I'm on your side! Honest!

00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:59.230
Jo-<i>san</i>...!

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:07.500
--What time is it?
--Just after 3:05.

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:14.380
What a relief! I was worried;
you stopped moving completely!

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:17.820
Those people saved you!

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:34.700
He removed the handcuffs.
Said he used to be a locksmith.

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:38.240
How about a drink, little lady?

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:40.640
Come have a bite too, m'boy!

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:45.420
Whenever there's trouble above,
our roost gets wrecked.

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:47.650
So we're always on guard.

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:51.590
To be honest, we don't
have nowhere else to go.

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:54.790
So we hafta make sure
we don't get noticed.

00:10:56.090 --> 00:10:58.400
Here ya are!

00:10:58.400 --> 00:10:59.930
Dunno what happened,

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:04.570
but you won't live long
getting into shootouts.

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:10.770
And the law don't help since
people's lives ain't worth garbage.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:15.510
But I hear more and more
people wanna be officers now.

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:18.450
Yeah, everyone but Japanese people!

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:22.020
This country don't belong
to us Japanese anymore.

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:25.510
Not like that's anything new, though.

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:29.430
Why didn't you run away?

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:31.460
What do you mean, why?

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:34.970
I can't just leave you
with such a bad injury.

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:37.700
It's my fault you got shot.

00:11:38.470 --> 00:11:45.310
You're really strong, Jo-<i>san</i>.
I probably would've given up by now.

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:49.080
Just Jo is fine.

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:53.280
Adding '<i>san</i>' nauseates me
and makes my body itch.

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:57.820
What's your name again?

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:01.060
Kyohei. Tachibana Kyohei!

00:12:01.060 --> 00:12:04.490
--First time I heard it.
--Oh, really...?

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:14.600
Oh, you really know how to eat!

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:20.840
Want more? I can catch some
more meat if there ain't enough!

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:25.650
Thanks. But there's no time.

00:12:25.650 --> 00:12:27.080
Let's go, Kyohei!

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:39.830
He's the type that'll get
henpecked for his entire life.

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:45.560
Nah, his kind do better than you'd think.
You just don't get it.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:55.810
We're gonna run for a while.
Can you keep up?

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:58.510
--I'll be fine!
--Here goes!

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:15.200
Get your ramen here!
A nice, hot bowl of ramen!

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:18.830
Hey! I'll take one!

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.020
Pull yourself together!

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:49.160
Impressive work, Jo.

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:52.740
Sei-<i>san</i>...

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.570
Outta the way, Sei!

00:13:54.570 --> 00:13:58.810
Calm down, Jo. The enemy is above us.

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:02.540
Besides, do you think you
can win against this many?

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:07.880
I'll fight until the
very end if I have to.

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:12.220
But when I kick the bucket,
you're going down too!

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:16.960
We've secured the enemy's hideout.

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:19.830
The monster crow has no place to go now.

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:23.700
If you assist me, we will
be able to rescue Meg.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:27.260
Besides, how do you plan
to fight it without Django?

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:31.710
We'll trade. Hand over Kyohei-<i>kun</i>.

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:32.940
No.

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:37.780
Do you think it won't care if
we don't trade for the hostage?!

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:42.680
I'll beat that crow and
save both of them!

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:47.690
Fine.

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:50.390
Let's have Kyohei-<i>kun</i> decide!

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:55.970
Will you take a chance and
go with Jo to save Meg,

00:14:55.970 --> 00:15:00.600
or will you stay and receive
our medical treatment?

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:04.600
It's your life on the line. You choose!

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:08.710
I can't just choose like that...!

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:16.650
I...

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:22.450
I think that Jo-<i>san</i>, I mean, Jo--

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:29.500
I think Jo can save Meg-<i>san</i>!

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:36.610
Sei! Why, you...!

00:15:36.610 --> 00:15:38.170
Calm down!

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:44.510
I shot him with a syncope dart to
temporarily slow his life functions.

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:48.850
His near-death state will
slow down the NI-50.

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:52.690
But keep in mind that
it won't last long.

00:16:09.270 --> 00:16:13.940
You're really after the
crow's brain, aren't you?

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:17.540
You wouldn't have been
waiting here otherwise!

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:22.550
I simply wanted to rescue
Meg and Kyohei-<i>kun</i> unhurt.

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:27.820
Of course, I needed
your help to do so...

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:30.990
...Your ability to hit
two birds with one stone.

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:35.100
Once I get Meg back and
kick that crow's butt,

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:38.930
I'm gonna come punch
that face of yours!

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.700
As you wish.

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:09.820
What you want is inside his body!

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:26.750
Meg!

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:29.080
Meg! Can you get over here?!

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:32.750
Jo...

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:36.980
Jo!

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:02.210
What is that?

00:18:05.820 --> 00:18:09.190
This can't be real! Jo can't lose!

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:11.520
This can't be for real!

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:17.900
What are you sleeping for?!
Jo just fell! Wake up!

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:36.850
Now you've done it, you damn crow!

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:40.520
Jo!

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:55.070
Oh, no, you don't!

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:09.450
Jo! Do you read me?!

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:13.860
I'm searching for the Lock Core
that's holding its body together!

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:18.290
Better make it quick!

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:30.110
Amy! Hurry it up!

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:50.350
Jo! Check the data!
That's the crow's weak spot!

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:14.350
Hurray!

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:43.340
You left it as cinders, but most of
it's destroyed beyond recognition.

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:47.420
Didn't have any choice.

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:50.940
Yeah. Recovery is going to be tough now.

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:53.260
Where's Kyohei?

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:57.760
Concerned? Don't worry,
he made it in time.

00:20:57.760 --> 00:21:00.990
As did all the girls the crow captured!

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:04.560
Pretty rare for you to save people.

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:06.870
Likewise!

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:10.370
Don't patronize me.

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:16.210
That reminds me, weren't you going
to punch someone once you returned?

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:17.870
You're not going to?

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:28.890
That soft-hearted guy would
probably tell me not to.

00:21:56.600 --> 00:22:04.270
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:04.270 --> 00:22:11.910
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:11.910 --> 00:22:19.620
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:19.620 --> 00:22:29.000
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:35.540
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:35.540 --> 00:22:44.550
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:44.550 --> 00:22:51.710
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:12.810 --> 00:23:15.180
<i>An old man who desires eternal growth</i>

00:23:15.180 --> 00:23:17.240
<i>and a youth entrusted with that hope.</i>

00:23:17.240 --> 00:23:21.480
<i>But when all becomes fiction,
the bloodshed begins.</i>

00:23:21.480 --> 00:23:25.980
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"Party of the Dragon"
